\f0\i\b\fs48 \cf0 \ul \ulc0 Intro:\

\f1\i0\b0 \ulnone \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\cf0 The Car Price Predictor is an end-to-end Machine Learning web application that estimates the selling price of a used car based on different input features provided by the user. The project combines data preprocessing, regression modelling, and a Flask web application to deliver real-time price predictions.\
The main objective of this project is to help buyers and sellers estimate a fair market price for a used car without manual calculations.\
Machine learning is widely used in price prediction problems because it can learn hidden relationships between different vehicle characteristics and their selling price. This project demonstrates the complete ML workflow from data.\
\
\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

